  "document": "Tajikistani somoni\nThe somoni (Tajik: cомонӣ , ISO 4217 code: TJS) is the currency of Tajikistan. It is subdivided into 100 diram (Tajik: дирам ). The currency is named after the father of the Tajik nation, Ismail Samani (also spelled \"Ismoil Somoni\")."
